comments.body:
@jaarkko On top of what @bobylito said, one thing that would help us understand what you want to achieve would be you mocking an interface you would like to build with the behaviors it should have.

Then starting from that, I believe we could extract both widgets and guides that would help others.

To start working on this we will need a more detailed explanation on what exactly you would like to be able to do with instansearch projects. Thanks!
